  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo></math>success, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo></math>failure</p><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>33</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>33</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>33</mn></mmultiscripts><mfenced><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>32</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now from equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math><